--
Regression for LinkedList.removeFirstOccurrence and
descendingIterator (REVIEW-PRE-PUSH high items 3, 4).

Pre-fix: removeFirstOccurrence/removeLastOccurrence called
CProver.notModelled() which throws — any code path reaching
them failed verification, even when the result was irrelevant.
descendingIterator returned a forward iterator (unsound for
any property over reverse iteration).

Post-fix: both methods are properly modelled with element-wise
loops (System.arraycopy is opaque in JBMC and cannot be used
to transfer Object[] contents). descendingIterator builds a
reversed copy of the backing array and iterates it forward,
preserving descending semantics without mutating the source.
